# Lite (UXC, beta, bridge), reads with 0x0 (follow the input): 1080p, 720p, unplug, replug.
chip ux
board beta
file /etc/kvm/hdmi_mode 0
file /kvmapp/kvm/state 0\n
file /kvmapp/kvm/width 1920\n
file /kvmapp/kvm/height 1080\n
src 1920 1080
vidbg auto
call init
at 200
int fall
at 500
call mjpeg 0 0 80 every 33 until 3000
at 3000
src 1280 720
int rise
int fall
at 3100
call mjpeg 0 0 80 every 33 until 6000
at 6000
src off
int fall
at 6100
call mjpeg 0 0 80 every 500 until 9000
call signal
at 9000
src 1920 1080
vidbg auto
int fall
at 9200
call mjpeg 0 0 80 every 33 until 12000
call signal
call deinit
at 15000
end
